# Build output - never commit compiled artifacts
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.pdb
*.dll

# Vendor installer packages: Microsoft PC Manager MSIX is proprietary and not redistributable,
# and the raw package is far above GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit
*.msixbundle
*.msix
*.appxbundle
*.appx

# Investigation / craft workspace artifacts (not part of the application)
.freebuff/
investigation.cany/
capture/
reference/
inbox/
craft.json
feed.json
transcript.json
usage.json
build-activity.log


# Documentation / specs / prompts (keep README.md only)
/*.md
!/README.md
!/app/**/*.md
/*.exe

# Local scratch
*.log
*.tmp
